 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Leray–Hopf weak existence in Lean",
  "excerpt": "A Lean 4 + mathlib formalization of **Leray–Hopf weak existence** for the incompressible Navier–Stokes equations, on the periodic 3-torus 𝕋³ and on whole space ℝ³. Each domain carries a finite-horizon capstone and a global-in-time capstone — four machine-checked existence theorems in all — and every one of them is **kernel-only**: `#print axioms` returns only the standard kernel axioms (`propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`), with zero project axioms and no `sorryAx`."
 },
